    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Multi-concern requests"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "A customer message may contain several issues (\"my order arrived damaged AND I was double-charged\"). Correct pattern: "
        },
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "decompose into distinct items → investigate each in parallel using shared context → synthesize a unified resolution"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ". Don't handle only the first issue or force the customer to re-ask."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Structured handoff protocol"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "When escalating mid-process, the human agent typically "
        },
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "cannot see the conversation transcript"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ". Compile a structured handoff summary:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Customer ID (verified)"
            }
          ],
          "marker": "none",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Root cause analysis"
            }
          ],
          "marker": "none",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Refund amount / financial exposure"
            }
          ],
          "marker": "none",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Recommended action"
            }
          ],
          "marker": "none",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
