    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Tool Design for Support Tools (Task Statements 2.1, 2.2)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Tool descriptions are THE selection mechanism"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "LLMs choose tools based primarily on their "
        },
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "descriptions"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ". Minimal descriptions (\"Retrieves customer information\" vs \"Retrieves order details\") cause misrouting between similar tools. A good description includes:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Purpose, clearly differentiated from similar tools"
            }
          ],
          "marker": "none",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Input formats it accepts (e.g., \"accepts order IDs of the form ORD-XXXXX\")"
            }
          ],
          "marker": "none",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Example queries it should handle"
            }
          ],
          "marker": "none",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Edge cases and boundaries (\"Use lookup_order for order status/details; use get_customer for account-level information\")"
            }
          ],
          "marker": "none",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "definition",
      "term": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Exam trap"
        }
      ],
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "when tool selection fails, the "
        },
        {
          "t": "em",
          "v": "first step"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " is enriching descriptions — not few-shot examples (token overhead, doesn't fix root cause), not a keyword-routing layer (over-engineered, bypasses the LLM), not consolidating tools (bigger change than a first step warrants)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Also review the "
        },
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "system prompt"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " for keyword-sensitive instructions that can override good descriptions and create unintended tool associations."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Structured error responses (MCP "
        },
        {
          "t": "code",
          "v": "isError"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " pattern)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Generic errors (\"Operation failed\") leave the agent unable to choose a recovery path. Return structured metadata:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "json",
      "code": "{\n  \"isError\": true,\n  \"errorCategory\": \"business\",        // transient | validation | business | permission\n  \"isRetryable\": false,\n  \"message\": \"Refunds over $500 require supervisor approval.\",\n  \"customerFacingExplanation\": \"This refund needs a quick supervisor review — I'm escalating it now.\"\n}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Error taxonomy to memorize:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Category"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Example"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Retryable?"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Agent's correct move"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Transient"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "timeout, service unavailable"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
